* First, check the **Gate of the Gods** (next to the {p:Home Point}) for a cutscene; otherwise, you will not have access to the upper floors (3-4).

=3 Retrieving your Light
* You need to climb to the 4th floor of a specific Tower in {z:The Garden of Ru'Hmet}, which are located in the 5 points of the map.
** Each Tower corresponds to one of the 5 races.
** {@k} {k:Light of Mea} - {p:Elvaan} (E).
** {@k} {k:Light of Dem} - {p:Mithra} (W).
** {@k} {k:Light of Holla} - {p:Tarutaru} (SW).
** {@k} {k:Light of Vahzl} - {p:Humes|Hume} (N).
** {@k} {k:Light of Al'Taieu} - {p:Galka} (SE).
* **{c=red:Note:}** Once you're on the 4th floor of your Tower, check the **Ebon Panel** twice. Once for a cutscene and a new title, then a second time for the Key Item of your race.
** Check any **Ebon Panel** in one of the towers will allow you to proceed with the mission. You don't have to climb the corresponding Tower, but you would not get a second cutscene and the new title if the tower doesn't match your race.
** This can be done solo, or with your party, but each person will need to get to the top of their corresponding Tower.
** After you've checked the Ebon Panel twice, to save time you can warp out and {p:Home Point} back to start the next section below.

=3 Brands of Dawn and Twilight
* Go to the central area of {z:The Garden of Ru'Hmet} on the first floor.
** You cannot reach the elevator directly. Instead, you must run around (first East, then North, then West) and access it from the other side.
* There are four spinning {m:Qn'zdei} on each side of the elevator.
** The doors will remain open as long as the {m:Qn'zdei} are on their pedestals.
** When aggro'd they will move off their pedestal, which causes the door at the far end of the room to close.
** These {m:Qn'zdei} are immune to {s:Sleep}, {s:Lullaby|Foe Lullaby (Scroll)}, and {s:Repose}.
** While not a challenge at iLvl, you will have to wait 5 minutes for respawn if you run through and kill them all.
** The larger crest is the {p:Zdei|Category:Zdei}'s "eye".
** The {p:Zdeis|Category:Zdei} only see with the side with the large blue "eye", and they detect by {@a:True Sight|Detects by True Sight} **True Sight** only. Therefore, by running along the wall, you only have to avoid detection by 2 of them.

>**If the door closes, simply kill them and auto-run towards the door and once they respawn (5 Minute Respawn) you will enter the door.**
* Once in the elevator room, step onto the platform and choose to **ascend**.
** Make sure to grab the {p:Home Point} in front of the elevator ramp before ascending.
* You must navigate this floor to collect both brands, **{c=#00CAF0:Twilight}** and **{c=#C68000:Dawn}** (Map 2).
** When using the **Warp Distortions**, {p:Trusts|Trust} will be de-summoned.
** The {@k} {k:Brand of Twilight} is to the south and the {@k} {k:Brand of Dawn} is to the north.
** {@k} {k:Brand of Dawn} takes less time to get, {@k} {k:Brand of Twilight} has a longer path.
* If you want to save time, warp out and use the {p:Home Point} to quickly return to the elevator after obtaining each key item.
** When you have both key items, proceed to the next section below here.

=3 Burning Circle Fight
* Head back to the central elevator and choose to **ascend** until you reach the 3rd floor in {z:The Garden of Ru'Hmet}.
** You will need both key items from the previous section to "ascend" twice, the 2nd time a different elevator animation occurs.
* Check the **Particle Gate** on the 3rd floor for a cutscene.
* Check it again to enter the BC.
* You begin the BC at the north end of the room, facing south at the pots.
** **Soloable at level 80+ with Trust. Possible at level 75+, but very difficult. Trivial at Item Level.**
* The BC is against four {m:Ix'zdei} NMs.
** The two larger ones are RDM type.
** The two smaller ones are BLM type.
** All of them are immune to silence and are heavily resistant to sleep.
** {p:Elemental Seal} is required to sleep the NMs.
** When a pot gets low on HP, it may attempt to flee to its spawn position. If it is allowed to be there a mere few seconds, it will regenerate to full HP.
*** Stun and the use of Weapon Skills may prevent this from happening.
** The safest place to die is at the door at the southern end of the room near the BLM pots. Wait for the pots to go back to their starting positions before Reraising.
** Every party member still alive will receive 1,000 {p:Experience Points} upon winning.
* Walk across the empty room and check the **Luminous Convergence** for a cutscene once you beat the pots.
* After the fight and the following cutscene head south to the 'Particle Gate'. Use this door: The exit to this BC is at the south side of the room.
** Choose the option "Leave the Garden of Ru'Hmet" then for the next option asking if you want to return to the grand palace choose "Yes".
** Head south to zone into {z:Al'Taieu} for a cutscene to finish this Mission and begin the next.

